{"4193700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gravity X Racers", "steam_appid": 4193700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Racers</strong> is a single-player arcade racing game set in open-world levels with adrenaline-filled tracks suspended in air. It’s designed for players who love downhill madness, realistic physics, and a hardcore challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your driving skills will be constantly tested. In the challange against gravity, every turn needs strategy, and drifting becomes your currency. Use the <strong>AGS (Anti-Gravity System)</strong> to survive extreme curves and inclines. The challenge is a nonstop run: <strong>no checkpoints, no respawns</strong>, only control and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world of Gravity Racers blends:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift mechanics and <strong>AGS</strong> to face extreme turns and steep climbs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track sections and terrain with variable gravity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunt Racing Downhill</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics simulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle destructibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obstacles to avoid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro mood with nostalgic elements (like steering wheel and pedal compatibility in UI controls).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you survive the battle against gravity?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Racers</strong> is a single-player arcade racing game set in open-world levels with adrenaline-filled tracks suspended in air. It’s designed for players who love downhill madness, realistic physics, and a hardcore challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your driving skills will be constantly tested. In the challange against gravity, every turn needs strategy, and drifting becomes your currency. Use the <strong>AGS (Anti-Gravity System)</strong> to survive extreme curves and inclines. The challenge is a nonstop run: <strong>no checkpoints, no respawns</strong>, only control and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world of Gravity Racers blends:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift mechanics and <strong>AGS</strong> to face extreme turns and steep climbs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track sections and terrain with variable gravity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunt Racing Downhill</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics simulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle destructibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obstacles to avoid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro mood with nostalgic elements (like steering wheel and pedal compatibility in UI controls).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you survive the battle against gravity?</strong></p>", "short_description": "An extreme Racing Arcade game blending Drift, real physics, high speed, and downhill tracks suspended in the air. Stay alive long enough to reach the finish line. It’s you versus gravity, one mistake and you’re done. One chance, zero respawns. Survive or fall.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193700/b3d8cae94f1a808d653585980dfb3fa431c298ce/header.jpg?t=1788223993", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193700/c73d45578a927635cde6ca9f1c2552988dbe4f22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788223993", "capsule_imagev5": "https://